    "level": "ordinary",
    "year": null,
    "question": "In the quadrilateral $PQRS$, $|PQ| = 3$ cm, $|QR| = 5$ cm and $\\angle PQR = 120^\\circ$.\nIn triangle $PRS$, $\\angle PRS = 45^\\circ$ and $\\angle PSR = 30^\\circ$.\nFind $|PS|$, correct to one decimal place.",
    "marks": 10,
    "steps": [
